# TA PTCS compatibility adapter

- 背景：Contracts/Reducer已完成，Renderer alpha1 milestone已push；task WBS最低進度是DYN-TA-004。
- 目標：在Dynamic facade加入transport-neutral runtime與PTCS既有authenticated extension/WebSocket seam之間的typed adapter，不改PTCS.Host。
- 計畫步驟：盤點PTCS seam與Dynamic facade註冊點；定義mapping/callback lifecycle；先寫deterministic adapter tests，再實作；若PTCS seam缺失則只修改PTCS core並留Host最後。
- 執行命令/參數：targeted rg/read、Release build、Expecto、必要F# Playwright live adapter驗證。
